            "issue": "The particle admits materially different tentative and scalar forces: a cautious suggestion such as “perhaps,” or an emphatic transition such as “not to mention.” The draft selects emphatic assurance without explaining that choice or preserving the tentative alternative. The confirmed printed punctuation does not by itself settle the particle’s force.",
